{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-200787-r4516589","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Chipotle Fried Chicken","sourcePageId":200787,"sourceRevision":"4516589","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-20T19:10:40Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Chipotle%20Fried%20Chicken&oldid=4516589","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:35:27.604Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Deep fried recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for spice mixes","Category:Recipes using cayenne","Category:Recipes using chicken","Category:Recipes using chipotle chile","Category:Recipes using cornmeal","Category:Recipes using lime juice","Category:Recipes using paprika","Category:Recipes using pepper","Category:Recipes using salt","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Southwestern recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"a1c37c0268f22abdb54cd323ef366fd8a2d6d4e74faa807f1255f8b44784ac6c","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Chicken recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n== Ingredients ==\n\n=== Meat ===\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Each|ea]]. skinless [[Cookbook:Chicken|chicken]] thighs, legs, and boneless skinless chicken breasts\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] adobo sauce\n* ¼ cup freshly-squeezed [[Cookbook:Lime|lime]] juice\n* [[Cookbook:Cornmeal|Cornmeal]] as needed\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] [[Cookbook:Shortening|vegetable shortening]]\n\n=== '''Seasoning''' ===\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Chipotle Pepper|chipotle]] powder\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Cayenne Pepper|cayenne pepper]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Garlic Powder|garlic powder]]\n* 2 tbsp smoked [[Cookbook:Paprika|paprika]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine adobo sauce and lime juice and pour over chicken. Refrigerate overnight.\n#Remove chicken from adobo mixture. Combine the seasoning ingredients, and sprinkle over chicken.\n#[[Cookbook:Dredging|Dredge]] chicken in cornmeal. Let rest for 2–3 minutes.\n#Meanwhile, heat shortening in a large cast-iron [[Cookbook:Skillet|skillet]] to 350°F. Place breasts and legs around the edges, then place thighs in the center.\n#Cook for 12 minutes per side. Drain on a [[Cookbook:Cooling Rack|cooling rack]] and serve.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chipotle chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lime juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes for spice mixes]]\n[[Category:Deep fried recipes]]\n[[Category:Southwestern recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cornmeal]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]\n[[Category:Recipes using paprika]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salt]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Chipotle Fried Chicken","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 ea. skinless chicken thighs, legs, and boneless skinless chicken breasts","sourceText":"2 ea. skinless chicken thighs, legs, and boneless skinless chicken breasts","amountText":"2 ea. skinless chicken thighs, legs, and boneless skinless chicken breast